    "standing": "Normative and CLOSED. WHERE a per-requirement sufficiency_v2 outcome travels once it leaves this unit, and in WHICH vocabulary. This block adds no member to DeficiencyV2, changes no carrier row above, adds no D9 class, code, exit or public detail code, and changes no D9 projection: it names the consumer boundary that was previously unnamed.",
